    "turn_text": "Yeah, so Lauren, thanks for coming on. I know your schedule is crazy, and I sent over a couple of things, just a couple of questions that we had, but a couple of them just around the packing, what your thoughts are on packing of the Supreme Court. Maybe you can give us your thoughts on that to start with.",
