    "turn_idx": 52,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, so, and frankly, we're at a material disadvantage because you have the media on one side that's just standing against the American people. You have big tech, which is silencing and censoring people for standing up and speaking truth. We have your loud voice, right? Your voice that is very, very, it's a courageous voice. And so it becomes very difficult to get all of this stuff across to the American people when it's not, it's almost like a vacuum, right? It feels like there, that there's no megaphone that is being given and that we're at a disadvantage. So now you are loud, but then they demonize you. And I know that we have Marjorie Taylor Greene that does the same thing. She stands up, you guys, probably two of the most courageous, most voiceless voices out there. What are you seeing that people can do in order to become that megaphone? What are you seeing that Max and I can do? And I know that I'm probably a little bit more voiceless than most, but what can other people do? Just people in the community, what can they do?",
