      },
      {
        "text": "The older generation has a responsibility to model truthful behavior and uphold foundational values.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Polling samples often consist of the same individuals repeatedly surveyed.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "After the event, all the teenagers reported learning something new about the Second Amendment and its historical significance.",
